    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Nightmare Kitchen: Welcome to the Greasepunk Apocalypse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Story So Far</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Tater Hills Mall, the proud home of Spudnik Biosystems, creators of the nutritional wonder-ingredient &quot;Cholesterite.&quot; Once hailed as a miracle, Cholesterite's side effects are now clear: an insatiable, demented army of mutant food bent on devouring humanity. Unfortunately, you're on today's menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as chefs from the mall's abandoned food court who find themselves strangely mutated and uniquely suited to fight back. Join other survivors trapped in this neon-lit nightmare, alone or in Co-Op with up to four players, as you battle to escape the cursed culinary apocalypse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Food-Fueled Foes:</strong><br>Face twisted, unsettling, and grotesque food monsters, each with  diabolical behaviors and attacks. Take on monstrous bosses like killer tacos, rabid salads, and vengeful desserts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Delicious Dungeons:</strong><br>Explore ever-changing layouts filled with deadly traps, challenging puzzles, and environments themed around American, Mexican, Asian, Dessert, and Health food.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Absurd Culinary Arsenal:</strong><br>Craft and wield  bizarre weapon combinations. Load your guns with  distinct food-based ammo types, each creating wild combat and environmental effects. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot and Leveling:</strong><br>Gather mountains of weird and powerful loot. Boost your chef's stats to gain an edge against your culinary nightmares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite Replayability:</strong><br>Death comes at a cost: you'll drop loot, weapons, and temporary upgrades. But don't worry because permanent upgrades, story progress, and hidden secrets carry over, ensuring every run feels rewarding and unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4-Player Co-Op Chaos:</strong><br>Team up with friends online to tackle the mall\u2019s greasy horrors. Survive, fight, and laugh through the madness together\u2014because everything\u2019s better with friends, even the apocalypse.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Nightmare Kitchen: Welcome to the Greasepunk Apocalypse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Story So Far</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Tater Hills Mall, the proud home of Spudnik Biosystems, creators of the nutritional wonder-ingredient &quot;Cholesterite.&quot; Once hailed as a miracle, Cholesterite's side effects are now clear: an insatiable, demented army of mutant food bent on devouring humanity. Unfortunately, you're on today's menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as chefs from the mall's abandoned food court who find themselves strangely mutated and uniquely suited to fight back. Join other survivors trapped in this neon-lit nightmare, alone or in Co-Op with up to four players, as you battle to escape the cursed culinary apocalypse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Food-Fueled Foes:</strong><br>Face twisted, unsettling, and grotesque food monsters, each with  diabolical behaviors and attacks. Take on monstrous bosses like killer tacos, rabid salads, and vengeful desserts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Delicious Dungeons:</strong><br>Explore ever-changing layouts filled with deadly traps, challenging puzzles, and environments themed around American, Mexican, Asian, Dessert, and Health food.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Absurd Culinary Arsenal:</strong><br>Craft and wield  bizarre weapon combinations. Load your guns with  distinct food-based ammo types, each creating wild combat and environmental effects. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot and Leveling:</strong><br>Gather mountains of weird and powerful loot. Boost your chef's stats to gain an edge against your culinary nightmares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite Replayability:</strong><br>Death comes at a cost: you'll drop loot, weapons, and temporary upgrades. But don't worry because permanent upgrades, story progress, and hidden secrets carry over, ensuring every run feels rewarding and unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4-Player Co-Op Chaos:</strong><br>Team up with friends online to tackle the mall\u2019s greasy horrors. Survive, fight, and laugh through the madness together\u2014because everything\u2019s better with friends, even the apocalypse.</p>",
    "short_description": "Hey, Chef! Welcome to Nightmare Kitchen, your new favorite roguelite shooter (bet you needed another one, right?). The mall\u2019s cursed, the food\u2019s alive, and your guns shoot food. Bring friends for co-op chaos, or brave this greasy apocalypse alone just remember, dying builds delicious character.",
